{"title":"2025 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part A","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A line has equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/9/e29d2131d86c742b8b6a2ca64123e013949e27ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = px + p^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"20\" /> for some real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />. The line passes through the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/7/c67aebf614d30319b965ca177c4b856bbc58dc69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y) = (6, -9)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"123\" height=\"20\" />. Determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/3/4b39f875699f7887941c1bd89737889f88dd9335.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(6, -9)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/f/50f1359401519445edee13702212fe411dd4741f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-9 = 6p + p^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"106\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/8/b1849b3e546597db2f12db55878f0283058bee99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p^{2} + 6p + 9 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"124\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/b/acbf962f44a484b3fbecb3f706d9837ca0843d10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(p + 3)^{2} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>From this, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/6/406e58f632c8d747df352c34f8c0dbed85df830a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{p = -3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"70\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018070418\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.009 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 45/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1635/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.037      1 2025_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\n100.00%    6.037      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37472:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018070418 and revision id 289509. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}